1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,560
There are so many mortals here,

25
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,720
they should be brimming with life.

26
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:07,380
So why is this death aura so prevalent ?

27
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,520
For a year,

28
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,920
I travelled through many cities all over Xue Yue.

29
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,720
There are no royal families here.

30
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,000
Instead,

31
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:26,880
every city belongs to a powerful cultivator.

32
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,160
Here,

33
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,840
the mortals are slaves.

34
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,460
The only meaning to their life

35
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:38,140
is to carve ice sculptures for cultivators

36
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:40,680
in order to make a living.

37
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,000
Thank you Immortal !

38
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:45,040
Mortals should have life energy,

39
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:48,400
but this death aura is particularly deep...

40
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:51,160
I don't like this place

41
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:55,040
but I believe I can gain a better understanding of Death here.

42
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:59,600
The ice sculptures of Xue Yue are very special.

43
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:02,980
The mortals carve the ice,

44
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:05,760
then a cultivator will place a formation on it

45
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:09,120
and use a secret technique.

46
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:13,120
The ice sculpture then comes to life and turns into a puppet.

47
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:15,560
This method is very mysterious...

48
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,840
I have been studying it for a long time

49
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:19,800
but I haven't learned anything yet.

50
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,200
My guess is

51
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:25,600
the ice sculptures are the foundation of Xue Yue.

52
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:27,440
If I can learn this method

53
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,550
and use it on wood carvings,

54
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:31,840
it will be very beneficial to me.

55
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,360
Xue Yue's defense has become weak

56
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:42,960
since the remnants of the Four Sect Alliance have been active.

57
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:46,400
Even if the Elders are not present,

58
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:50,260
these disorganized groups that fled the country won't pose a threat.

59
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,800
Let's deal with those who remained in Xue Yue first

60
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,160
and then we'll get rid of those who fled.

61
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:57,040
Let's take our time.

62
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:58,570
Senior Brother,

63
00:03:58,640 --> 00:04:02,000
are there still no news from the country of Suzaku ?

64
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,450
It's been several years

65
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:09,840
since the Elders went to Suzaku.

66
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:12,560
How can there be no news at all !?

67
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:16,960
The technique to forcefully raise the cultivation of an individual

68
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:19,600
must not be easy to pull off.

69
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:22,360
Now that we have our new land,

70
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:24,960
to raise our country to rank 5

71
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:28,280
we need a cultivator to reach Soul Transformation.

72
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,680
There's no other way.

73
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:33,880
The empowerment ceremony is too risky !

74
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:36,320
Everyone only has one shot at it.

75
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,760
Even if one reaches Soul Transformation,

76
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:40,960
he will only have 100 years of lifespan

77
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:43,840
and will forever be stuck at Early stage

78
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,600
without being able to breakthrough !

79
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:49,120
I hope that among the Elders

80
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:52,400
at least one will be able to reach Soul Transformation.

81
00:04:53,640 --> 00:04:55,800
That way, we will have 100 years

82
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:59,440
to solidify our position as rank 5.

83
00:05:06,630 --> 00:05:07,840
It seems

84
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:11,800
that Xue Yue is governed locally by City Lords.

85
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:16,880
So their strength must vary from city to city.

86
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:20,320
11 floors ?

87
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:31,880
Who...

88
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:33,080
Sun Shouyi\N72nd Xue Yue City Lord\NLate stage Core Formation

89
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:33,080
Who are you ?

90
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:36,240
I need your identity.

91
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,020
How dare you !

92
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,520
I'm the City Lord !

93
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,200
Master.

94
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,680
 Sun Shouyi's third disciple\NLate stage Foundation Establishment

95
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,680
Sun Shouyi's second disciple\NLate stage Foundation Establishment

96
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,040
According to this person's memory,

97
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:09,080
this girl often serves him personally.

98
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,320
Master...

99
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:14,000
I didn't expect that in Xue Yue,

100
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:18,320
a disciple serving his master would be so common.

101
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,360
Have any new ice embryos arrived ?

102
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,280
Master,

103
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,760
2 of them just arrived.

104
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,150
Bring them out

105
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:30,880
and let me see if your skills have improved.

106
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:31,640
Understood.

107
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,440
According to this person's memory,

108
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,400
the technique's first step

109
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:13,520
is to construct 9 blood veins in the ice embryo.

110
00:07:13,890 --> 00:07:14,760
The next step

111
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:19,120
is to use the Icy Snow Tactic of Xue Yue to activate it.

112
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,040
Master...

113
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:27,680
You haven't answered my question from a few days ago

114
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,640
so disciple's cultivation is having problems.

115
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:33,720
Please come and instruct me tonight.

116
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,520
Speak,

117
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,760
what's the issue ?

118
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:41,040
Master...

119
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:43,120
Do we talk about it here ?

120
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,480
Master,

121
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,480
disciple was wrong !

122
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:57,960
I didn't think straight.

123
00:07:59,230 --> 00:08:00,120
Continue.

124
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,720
Bones of ice,

125
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,360
soul of snow !

126
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,480
Disciple

127
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,720
failed again.

128
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,400
According to this person's memory,

129
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:27,400
the Icy Snow Tactic emphasizes refining the heart.

130
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:30,640
This technique uses ice as the bones and snow as the soul

131
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:33,190
to form an ice and snow soul

132
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:35,520
and reach the state of a clear heart.

133
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,960
It's very meticulous but unstable.

134
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,800
There is no room for error.

135
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,000
Senior Brother is back !

136
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:46,200
Disciple greets Master.

137
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,520
I have found the place

138
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,880
where remnants of the Four Sect Alliance are hiding.

139
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:52,440
How about

140
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:55,040
we call Zhao Li of the Ice Snow Palace

141
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:56,960
and ask them to send...

142
00:08:56,740 --> 00:08:57,400
Lead the way.

143
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:11,840
Master,

144
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:12,960
it's right here.

145
00:09:14,890 --> 00:09:16,840
I sense a restriction that's guarding 2 cultivators.

146
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,440
One is just a Core Formation.

147
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,480
The other one

148
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,480
oscillates between Core Formation

149
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,000
and Nascent Soul.

150
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:28,400
There are even hints of Soul Formation.

151
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,920
It looks like his cultivation is collapsing

152
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,400
and he's about to die.

153
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,080
You wait here.

154
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:39,280
Master never took risks himself before...

155
00:09:58,400 --> 00:10:00,240
Chen Huan\NBlack Soul Sect Junior Sect Leader \NEarly stage Core Formation

156
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,480
Please don't kill my master,

157
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:14,840
kill me instead !

158
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,200
I'm the Junior Sect Leader of the Black Soul Sect.

159
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,280
If you capture me,

160
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:19,040
you will be rewarded.

161
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:21,440
Please spare my master.

162
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:25,040
Why do you want to exchange your life for your master's ?

163
00:10:25,670 --> 00:10:27,280
If my master didn't have

164
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:29,040
to drag me around,

165
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:32,080
he would have left a long time ago.

166
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,440
But he tried to save me...

167
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:34,640
Huan'er,

168
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,400
get up.

169
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:39,720
This person is not a cultivator of Xue Yue.

170
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,400
Master...

171
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,680
you're awake !

172
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,880
Junior greets Senior of the Black Soul Sect.

173
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:49,220
This person is surronded by a death aura,

174
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:51,270
he's about to die.

175
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:53,010
He's beyond saving.

176
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,240
Little friend,

177
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:57,320
this old man's body is too injured

178
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:59,240
to greet you properly.

179
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:01,520
I hope you will forgive me.

180
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,840
Senior's hiding place

181
00:11:03,280 --> 00:11:05,600
has been found by Xue Yue cultivators

182
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,520
so it's best to leave now.

183
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:11,240
I've lived in the Four Sects Alliance for more than 30 years.

184
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:12,720
But I couldn't help much

185
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,080
during the war with Xue Yue.

186
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,280
This time,

187
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,520
I will do my best to help.

188
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,280
Your injury is too serious

189
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:24,520
for this bottle of pills to heal, but it can ease the pain.

190
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,090
This should allow you to leave this place.

191
00:11:27,880 --> 00:11:29,120
The world is big

192
00:11:29,190 --> 00:11:30,670
so there might be other chances

193
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:32,560
to recover your cultivation.

194
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,160
Little friend,

195
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,470
I don't know what Sect you're from,

196
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:39,520
but if I wanted to leave,

197
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:42,600
I could have left back then.

198
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,880
Even if it means,

199
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:47,920
speeding up the loss of my cultivation.

200
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:50,480
I can still leave right now.

201
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:51,600
However,

202
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:55,320
do you know why I don't want to leave ?

203
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:02,320
This is my home.

204
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,640
I was born here

205
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:07,040
and when I die,

206
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:10,240
it will also be here.

207
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,120
Little friend,

208
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:21,080
this artifact is for you.

209
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:28,560
It's to thank you for the pills you've given me.

210
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:36,640
Thank you, Senior.

211
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,600
Huan'er,

212
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,160
it's time to go.

213
00:12:41,230 --> 00:12:42,040
Master,

214
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,200
where are we going ?

215
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,600
I woke up today

216
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:47,160
like a candle before it's extinguished.

217
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:52,920
Go,

218
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:56,880
you will have to rely on yourself in the future

219
00:12:57,400 --> 00:13:00,000
because Master can't protect you anymore.

220
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:00,800
No...

221
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,120
Master...

222
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,040
don't...

223
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:07,680
Master !

224
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:40,920
Master !

225
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,800
You bastards of Xue Yue...

226
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,280
Come here !

227
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:48,680
Even if I die today,

228
00:13:49,270 --> 00:13:50,400
I will die

229
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:53,360
while protecting my country !

230
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:31,760
The fake Red Butterfly's sacrifice...

231
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,640
The fear of death of Xue Yue's mortals...

232
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:38,520
The generosity of this Senior towards me...

233
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:41,920
Master !!!

234
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:44,600
It turns out that Death

235
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,680
has many different meanings.

236
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:55,640
3 years later

237
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,490
Spring and autumn pass by,

238
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:01,040
snow falls as winter comes again.

239
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,360
My research on the ice sculptures

240
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:08,400
has made some progress.

241
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:13,120
The ice sculptures are maintained by the blood veins.

242
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:16,280
A sculpture with 49 blood veins

243
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:18,920
is able to achieve Core Formation level.

244
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:22,640
The more blood veins in the sculpture,

245
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,480
the stronger it is.

246
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:27,520
But if they collide with each other,

247
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:30,480
the sculpture will collapse.

248
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:33,480
This Icy Snow Tactic

249
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:35,760
cannot be considered correct.

250
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:39,800
It's definitely a branch of something else.

251
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:43,960
It's similar to the Six Desire Devil Lord's cultivation method.

252
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:48,840
Instead of snow blood,

253
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:51,520
these veins use pure blood.

254
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:55,480
This way I give it a bit of Life and Death Domain

255
00:15:56,230 --> 00:15:58,070
to be able to control it.

256
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:11,760
4 years have passed.

257
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,240
It's time to leave.

258
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:53,720
In the war,

259
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:56,160
I've seen many deaths.

260
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:01,440
My feelings towards Death are still profound.

261
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:12,190
Master,

262
00:17:12,320 --> 00:17:13,560
where are we going now ?

263
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:18,640
I will return to my roots.

264
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:22,240
But where is my home ?

265
00:17:38,040 --> 00:17:39,960
I'm a year away from Soul Formation.

266
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:41,320
I was born in Zhao,

267
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:43,160
so I will return to Zhao.

268
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:45,760
That's the law of cause and effect.

269
00:17:55,510 --> 00:20:42,110
“I, Chen Huan, swear that I’ll wipe out Xue Yue !”\NWang Lin returned to the ice tower with a complicated state of mind. Although he had obtained a powerful artifact, he didn’t feel happy. He only felt a sense of melancholy.\NAt this moment, Wang Lin suddenly gained another bit of insight of his Life and Death Domain.\N\N“What is Life… what is Death…”\N\NThis question echoed in Wang Lin’s mind.\NThe late stage Soul Formation cultivator of the Black Soul Sect used the last of his cultivation to fly up to the snow fairy statue at the Divine Temple of Snow and Ice. Like a moth flying toward a flame, he exploded on the statue, leaving behind a red mark that they couldn’t get rid of.\NAlong with him, several other Soul Formation cultivators were killed in this explosion.\NAll the glory was now gone with the wind…\NIn his death, he died at the right spot. His death awakened the Four Sect Alliance cultivators that hadn’t dared to show their faces.\N\NIn the blink of an eye, another year passed.\N\NThroughout this year, Wang Lin kept thinking about the Life and Death Domain, and he gradually gained more insight. His own being had undergone a transformation in this past year.\NLooking at a mountain as a mountain, looking at a river as a river.\NHowever, Wang Lin noticed that sometimes a mountain isn’t mountain and a river isn’t a river. It was as if there was another layer of fog blocking his eyes. He couldn’t see it, but he could feel it. When he reached out, he couldn’t touch it.\NThis type of thing won’t go away with time. He would need a sudden burst of insight to get past the fog.

270
00:18:03,890 --> 00:18:07,770
I've had my share of wounds,

271
00:18:05,930 --> 00:18:07,770
now I want to fight back.

272
00:18:07,850 --> 00:18:11,330
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

273
00:18:11,410 --> 00:18:17,250
that's blocking all my hopes

274
00:18:14,290 --> 00:18:17,250
for life ?

275
00:18:19,050 --> 00:18:23,010
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

276
00:18:20,770 --> 00:18:23,010
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

277
00:18:23,330 --> 00:18:26,410
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

278
00:18:26,770 --> 00:18:32,410
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

279
00:18:29,490 --> 00:18:32,410
out of reach.

280
00:18:33,770 --> 00:18:37,890
Immortals

281
00:18:34,810 --> 00:18:37,890
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

282
00:18:38,170 --> 00:18:41,930
Renegades

283
00:18:38,930 --> 00:18:41,930
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

284
00:18:41,930 --> 00:18:45,770
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

285
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:45,770
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

286
00:18:46,010 --> 00:18:49,890
because I don't see the harm in that.

287
00:18:51,890 --> 00:18:57,690
My new body opens its eyes

288
00:18:54,410 --> 00:18:57,690
and awakens from its dream.

289
00:18:57,810 --> 00:19:05,250
I have overcome many trials

290
00:18:59,930 --> 00:19:05,250
to get this body back.

291
00:19:05,450 --> 00:19:12,890
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

292
00:19:09,490 --> 00:19:12,890
I can still see.

293
00:19:13,290 --> 00:19:22,250
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

294
00:19:17,250 --> 00:19:22,250
by my own hands.

295
00:19:53,130 --> 00:19:59,090
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

296
00:19:55,850 --> 00:19:59,090
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

297
00:19:59,090 --> 00:20:06,650
With a flick of a finger,

298
00:20:00,530 --> 00:20:06,650
only my indomitable heart remains.

299
00:20:06,690 --> 00:20:16,050
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

300
00:20:12,650 --> 00:20:16,050
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

301
00:20:16,290 --> 00:20:23,890
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

302
00:20:18,810 --> 00:20:23,890
like the descent of a god.
